#. ja: サンドリーチ
#. de: Sandegel
#. fr: sangsue des sables
#. column 2: sand leeches
#. column 8: A spineless creature which hides patiently under the desert─ofttimes for several moons─until a larger beast passes nearby. The leech will then attach itself to the new host's leg and proceed to drink deep of the beast's blood until its belly is full, after which it releases itself back to the desert to wait for its next victim. Live bait for dunefishing.
#. column 9: Sand Leech
msgctxt "Item:2600:0:0"
msgid "sand leech"
msgstr "песчаная пиявка"

#. de: Sandegel
#. fr: sangsues des sables
#. column 0: sand leech
#. column 8: A spineless creature which hides patiently under the desert─ofttimes for several moons─until a larger beast passes nearby. The leech will then attach itself to the new host's leg and proceed to drink deep of the beast's blood until its belly is full, after which it releases itself back to the desert to wait for its next victim. Live bait for dunefishing.
#. column 9: Sand Leech
msgctxt "Item:2600:0:2"
msgid "sand leeches"
msgstr "песчаные пиявки"

#. ja: 砂漠に棲息する無脊椎動物。砂海釣り用活餌
#. de: Der Sandegel versteckt sich oft mehrere Monde lang unter dem Wüstenboden, bis eine größere Kreatur vorbeikommt. An dieser saugt er sich dann fest und trinkt solange von dessen Blut, bis sein Magen voll ist und er sich wieder in den Sand fallen lässt. Lebendköder für das Dünenfischen.
#. fr: Cet invertébré vit dans le sable.<br>Appât vivant pour la pêche en milieu désertique.
#. column 0: sand leech
#. column 2: sand leeches
#. column 9: Sand Leech
msgctxt "Item:2600:0:8"
msgid "A spineless creature which hides patiently under the desert─ofttimes for several moons─until a larger beast passes nearby. The leech will then attach itself to the new host's leg and proceed to drink deep of the beast's blood until its belly is full, after which it releases itself back to the desert to wait for its next victim. Live bait for dunefishing."
msgstr "Беспозвоночное, терпеливо затаившееся под песками пустыни, порой на несколько лун, пока мимо не пройдёт зверь покрупнее. Тогда пиявка цепляется за его лапу и досыта пьёт кровь, после чего отпускает жертву и снова зарывается в песок, поджидая следующую. Живая наживка для пустынной рыбалки."

