msgid "Sand Leech"
msgstr "Песчаная пиявка"

#. ja: テッポウムシ
#. de: Stammwurm
#. fr: ver huhu
#. column 2: stem borers
#. column 8: This longhorn beetle larva can most commonly be found burrowed deep into the trunks of fallen logs. Live bait for freshwater fishing.
#. column 9: Stem Borer
