#. ja: サンドゲッコー
#. de: Sandgecko
#. fr: gecko des sables
#. column 2: sand geckos
#. column 8: When night falls, thousands of these tiny scalekin can be seen scampering about the Sagolii Desert in search of the beetles on which they dine. Live bait for dunefishing.
#. column 9: Sand Gecko
msgctxt "Item:2602:0:0"
msgid "sand gecko"
msgstr "песчаный геккон"

