msgstr "Песчаный геккон"

#. ja: グロウワーム
#. de: Glühwürmchen
#. fr: ver luisant
#. column 2: glowworms
#. column 8: It is not known why one end of these vilekin shines bright like a candle. It is, however, known that the light emitted by these creatures makes them a perfect target for hungry fish. Live bait for freshwater and ocean fishing.
#. column 9: Glowworm
msgctxt "Item:2603:0:0"
msgid "glowworm"
msgstr "светящийся червь"

#. de: Glühwürmchen
#. fr: vers luisants
#. column 0: glowworm
#. column 8: It is not known why one end of these vilekin shines bright like a candle. It is, however, known that the light emitted by these creatures makes them a perfect target for hungry fish. Live bait for freshwater and ocean fishing.
#. column 9: Glowworm
msgctxt "Item:2603:0:2"
msgid "glowworms"
msgstr "светящиеся черви"

#. ja: 発光器官を有する甲虫の幼虫。集魚性の高い、淡水／海水釣り両用活餌
#. de: Es ist nicht bekannt, warum ein Ende dieser Kreatur wie eine Kerze leuchtet. Allerdings weiß man, dass dieses Licht enorm effektiv ist, um hungrige Fische anzuocken. Ein Köder für alle Fälle.
#. fr: Ce lampyre a pour faculté de briller dans la nuit, ce qui attire fortement le poisson.<br>Appât vivant pour la pêche en eau douce ou en mer.
#. column 0: glowworm
#. column 2: glowworms
#. column 9: Glowworm
msgctxt "Item:2603:0:8"
msgid "It is not known why one end of these vilekin shines bright like a candle. It is, however, known that the light emitted by these creatures makes them a perfect target for hungry fish. Live bait for freshwater and ocean fishing."
msgstr "Неизвестно, отчего один конец этих мерзких созданий светится, словно свеча. Зато известно, что этот свет привлекает голодную рыбу. Живая наживка для пресноводной и морской рыбалки."

#. ja: グロウワーム
#. de: Glühwürmchen
#. fr: Ver luisant
#. column 0: glowworm
#. column 2: glowworms
