#. ja: バルーンバグ
#. de: Ballonkäfer
#. fr: scaraballon
#. column 2: balloon bugs
#. column 8: With wings too underdeveloped for flying, this beetle has adopted another method of locomotion about the Sea of Clouds─a second bladder it fills with a noxious lighter-than-air gas. This foul stench is known to attract larger, hungrier creatures. Live bait for skyfishing.
#. column 9: Balloon Bug
msgctxt "Item:2609:0:0"
msgid "balloon bug"
msgstr "жук-шарик"

#. de: Ballonkäfer
