#. column 0: spinner
#. column 2: spinners
#. column 8: A metal river lure designed to resemble both a mayfly and a minnow, allowing for use in a variety of different situations.
msgctxt "Item:2620:0:9"
msgid "Spinner"
msgstr "Вращающаяся блесна"

#. ja: クリルフィーダー
#. de: Krillkäfig-Köder
#. fr: amorçoir à krill
#. column 2: krill cage feeders
#. column 8: A small metal cage packed with northern krill. Fish are drawn to the area as krill float off from the cage. Processed bait for ocean fishing.
#. column 9: Krill Cage Feeder
msgctxt "Item:2621:0:0"
msgid "krill cage feeder"
msgstr "кормушка с крилем"

#. de: Krillkäfig-Köder
#. fr: amorçoirs à krill
#. column 0: krill cage feeder
#. column 8: A small metal cage packed with northern krill. Fish are drawn to the area as krill float off from the cage. Processed bait for ocean fishing.
#. column 9: Krill Cage Feeder
msgctxt "Item:2621:0:2"
msgid "krill cage feeders"
msgstr "кормушки с крилем"

#. ja: オキアミを詰め込んだ金属製のカゴ。海釣り用コマセ餌
#. de: Ein kleiner Metallkäfig mit Nordkrill. Fische werden durch Krill angelockt, die aus dem Käfig treiben. Für Meeresfische geeignet.
#. fr: Cette cage en métal permet, garnie d'une esche de pâte de krill, d'attirer des poissons.<br>Stimulant pour la pêche en mer.
#. column 0: krill cage feeder
#. column 2: krill cage feeders
#. column 9: Krill Cage Feeder
msgctxt "Item:2621:0:8"
msgid "A small metal cage packed with northern krill. Fish are drawn to the area as krill float off from the cage. Processed bait for ocean fishing."
msgstr "Небольшая металлическая клетка, набитая северным крилем. Выплывающие из неё креветки приманивают рыбу. Готовая наживка для морской рыбалки."

