msgctxt "Item:2621:0:9"
msgid "Krill Cage Feeder"
msgstr "Кормушка с крилем"

#. ja: ミスリルスプーン
#. de: Mithrillöffel-Köder
#. fr: cuiller en mithril
#. column 2: mythril spoon lures
#. column 8: A polished mythril lure shaped like a spoon so it will oscillate when dragged through the water, attracting all manner of lake and marsh life.
#. column 9: Mythril Spoon Lure
msgctxt "Item:2622:0:0"
msgid "mythril spoon lure"
msgstr "митриловая блесна-ложка"

#. de: Mithrillöffel-Köder
#. fr: cuillers en mithril
#. column 0: mythril spoon lure
#. column 8: A polished mythril lure shaped like a spoon so it will oscillate when dragged through the water, attracting all manner of lake and marsh life.
#. column 9: Mythril Spoon Lure
msgctxt "Item:2622:0:2"
msgid "mythril spoon lures"
msgstr "мифриловая блесна-ложка"

#. ja: スプーン形の湖沼釣り用霊銀製ルアー。神秘的な煌きが、魚を引きつける
#. de: Ein polierter Messingköder, der wie ein Löffel geformt ist, damit er pendelt, während man ihn durchs Wasser zieht und dadurch Fische anlockt. Besonders effektiv in Seen.
#. fr: Un leurre en métal brillant dont la forme rappelle une cuiller en mithril. Il tourne et émet des vibrations lorsque la ligne est ramenée.<br>Leurre pour la pêche en lacs et marais.
#. column 0: mythril spoon lure
#. column 2: mythril spoon lures
#. column 9: Mythril Spoon Lure
msgctxt "Item:2622:0:8"
msgid "A polished mythril lure shaped like a spoon so it will oscillate when dragged through the water, attracting all manner of lake and marsh life."
msgstr "Полированная приманка из мифрила в форме ложки. При проводке она колеблется в воде и привлекает самых разных озёрных и болотных обитателей."

#. ja: ミスリルスプーン
#. de: Mithrillöffel-Köder
#. fr: Cuiller en mithril
#. column 0: mythril spoon lure
#. column 2: mythril spoon lures
#. column 8: A polished mythril lure shaped like a spoon so it will oscillate when dragged through the water, attracting all manner of lake and marsh life.
msgctxt "Item:2622:0:9"
msgid "Mythril Spoon Lure"
msgstr "Мифриловая блесна-ложка"

#. ja: フェザントフライ
#. de: Fasanfliege
#. fr: mouche tetrax
#. column 2: wildfowl flies
#. column 8: A freshwater lure made from a wildfowl feather. Its uncanny resemblance to a mayfly makes it irresistible to vilekin-feeding fish such as trout.
#. column 9: Wildfowl Fly
msgctxt "Item:2623:0:0"
msgid "wildfowl fly"
msgstr "перо фазана"

#. de: Fasanfliegen
#. fr: mouches tetrax
#. column 0: wildfowl fly
#. column 8: A freshwater lure made from a wildfowl feather. Its uncanny resemblance to a mayfly makes it irresistible to vilekin-feeding fish such as trout.
#. column 9: Wildfowl Fly
msgctxt "Item:2623:0:2"
msgid "wildfowl flies"
msgstr "перья фазана"

#. ja: カゲロウの幼虫を模した淡水釣り用フライルアー。トラウトなどの食虫性の魚に効果が高い
#. de: Dieser Köder aus einer Fasanenfeder wurde einer Fliege nachempfunden. Geeignet für das Angeln von Fischen, die sich von Insekten ernähren, wie zum Beispiel Forellen.
#. fr: Un leurre fait à partir d'une plume de tetrax et ressemblant à un insecte volant, par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement adapté à la pêche aux espèces insectivores comme la truite.<br>Leurre pour la pêche en eau douce.
#. column 0: wildfowl fly
#. column 2: wildfowl flies
#. column 9: Wildfowl Fly
msgctxt "Item:2623:0:8"
msgid "A freshwater lure made from a wildfowl feather. Its uncanny resemblance to a mayfly makes it irresistible to vilekin-feeding fish such as trout."
msgstr "Приманка для пресноводной рыбалки, сделанная из пера дикой птицы. Поразительно похожая на подёнку, она не оставит равнодушной рыбу, питающуюся насекомыми, например форель."

#. ja: フェザントフライ
