#. fr: Mouche tetrax
#. column 0: wildfowl fly
#. column 2: wildfowl flies
#. column 8: A freshwater lure made from a wildfowl feather. Its uncanny resemblance to a mayfly makes it irresistible to vilekin-feeding fish such as trout.
msgctxt "Item:2623:0:9"
msgid "Wildfowl Fly"
msgstr "Перо фазана"

#. ja: トップウォーターフロッグ
#. de: Schwimmfrosch
#. fr: grenouille sèche
#. column 2: topwater frogs
#. column 8: A light freshwater lure crafted to resemble a frog. Best suited for larger prey such as pikes and certain trout.
#. column 9: Topwater Frog
msgctxt "Item:2624:0:0"
msgid "topwater frog"
msgstr "поверхностная лягушка"

#. de: Schwimmfrösche
#. fr: grenouilles sèches
#. column 0: topwater frog
#. column 8: A light freshwater lure crafted to resemble a frog. Best suited for larger prey such as pikes and certain trout.
#. column 9: Topwater Frog
msgctxt "Item:2624:0:2"
msgid "topwater frogs"
msgstr "поверхностные лягушки"

#. ja: 蛙を模した淡水釣り用木製ルアー。大型のトラウトやパイク狙いによく利用される
#. de: Dieser Köder wurde einem kleinen Frosch nachempfunden. Er schwimmt an der Was<shy>ser<shy>o<shy>ber<shy>flä<shy>che und eignet sich gut, um Süßwasserfische, zum Beispiel Forelle und Hecht, zu angeln.
#. fr: Un leurre en bois imitant une grenouille qui flotte et fait jaillir des éclaboussures lorsque la ligne est ramenée. Il est par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement adapté à la pêche aux gros poissons comme les truites ou les brochets.<br>Leurre pour la pêche en eau douce.
#. column 0: topwater frog
#. column 2: topwater frogs
#. column 9: Topwater Frog
msgctxt "Item:2624:0:8"
msgid "A light freshwater lure crafted to resemble a frog. Best suited for larger prey such as pikes and certain trout."
msgstr "Лёгкая приманка для пресноводной рыбалки в виде лягушки. Лучше всего подходит для крупной рыбы, например щуки и некоторых видов форели."

