#. ja: レインボースプーン
#. de: Blinker
#. fr: cuiller arc-en-ciel
#. column 2: rainbow spoon lures
#. column 8: A shiny blacklip oyster shell lure shaped like a spoon so it will oscillate when dragged through the water, attracting all manner of aquatic life. Especially effective in lakes.
#. column 9: Rainbow Spoon Lure
msgctxt "Item:2625:0:0"
msgid "rainbow spoon lure"
msgstr "радужная блесна"

#. de: Blinker
#. fr: cuillers arc-en-ciel
